  "body": "Now Priced at $958,000!\r\n\r\nBargain Freehold Home in Bucklands Beach\r\n\r\nOne of the most affordable brand-new 4-bedroom homes in Bucklands Beach, this architecturally designed terrace home is selling quickly. Spanning approximately 156.8sqm (mol), this stylish three-level home offers 4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms including two master suites, open-plan living, a designer kitchen with premium appliances, sunny balcony views, internal access garage plus extra parking, and a private outdoor deck perfect for entertaining.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of walking distance to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak'nSave, Woolworths, cafés, restaurants, parks and public amenities. Zoned for sought-after schools including Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College.\r\n\r\nBuilt by a reputable developer and backed by a 10-Year Master Builder Guarantee, this is the perfect opportunity for first-home buyers, families, or smart investors seeking low-maintenance living in a premium location. No Body Corp or Society fees.\r\n\r\nAct fast – at $958,000 this one won't last!",
